                        // `var f := a.Add;` gave the LocalDecl no inferred
                        // type at all (ExprTypecheck.cpp's `lsym->declType =
                        // ctx_.exprType(*ld->initializer)` -> null), so
                        // codegen's lowerLocalDecl fallback
